ation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $61.6 million.","cites":["GLW.pay.peoTotal.2025","GLW.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $8.7 million in total and $16.8 million actually paid.","cites":["GLW.pay.neoTotal.2025","GLW.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $279.06 at the end of FY2025, and $249.73 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["GLW.pay.tsr.2025","GLW.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $1.5 billion at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $1.1 billion a year earlier.","cites":["GLW.deferred.2025","GLW.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 67,200 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $233,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["GLW.q.employees","GLW.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $1.5 billion in cash and cash equivalents, and $8.4 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtAndCapitalLeaseObligations + DebtCurrent). Debt less cash was $6.9 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["GLW.cash.2025","GLW.debtLong.2025","GLW.debtCurrent.2025"]}]},"fin":{"GLW":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":123,"read":123,"other":3,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Gullo Michelle L","Senior Vice President & CHRO"],["STEVERSON LEWIS A","Vice Chairman, EVP and CLAO"],["WEEKS WENDELL P","Chairman, CEO and President, director"],["Amin Jaymin","SVP and Chief Tech. Officer"],["Nelson Avery H III","Executive Vice President & COO"],["Verkleeren Ronald L","SVP Emerging Innovations Group"],["Zhang John Z","Exec. Vice President & CCDO"],["Seetharam S